      "content": "That makes sense. I'm also seeing some very irregular, almost scattered patterns of breakage in this specific layer, where the fragments seem much more dispersed than in the layers above or below. Does the way these pieces are distributed or the specific way they've shattered suggest anything about the degradation process or the environment of the site over time?",
